    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE DATE:\n1st\nAPRIL.\n1955\nQANTAS\nTIMETABLE\nSCHEDULES \u0026 FARES\nAUSTRALIA'S OVERSEAS AIRLINE",
      "There's\nair of\nlegance\nin the air...\nWith the introduction of the\ngiant new Super-Constellation, Qantas\nbrings you a new standard of international\ntravel luxury.\nLatest, largest and most modern of the\nfamous Constellation family, the Super\nConstellation features more spacious\npassenger accommodation, increased speed\nand greater power.\nThe luxurious interior decoration and\nultra-modern fittings immeasurably\nincrease your comfort, relaxation and\ntravel enjoyment.\nFor your overseas trip, ask first about the\nQantas Super Constellation-the most\nmodern airliner flying over the world's\ntrunk routes. Your Travel Agent will\ngladly give you full information.\nON\nQANTAS\nSuper Constellations",
      "Fly QANTAS - There's a world of difference--..\nTO MONTREAL.\nTO NEW YORK\nZURICH\nROME (\nCAIRO\nLONDON.\n\u003e FRANKFURT\nBEIRUT\n• TOKYO\nIWAKUNL\nVANCOUVER 9\nSAN FRANCISCO\nCONNECTING\nSERVICES\nOLOS ANGELES\nMONTREAL\nBOSTON\n8-\nNEW YORK\nTO LONDON\nJOHANNESBURG\nKARACHI\nHONG KONG\nCALCUTTA\nHONOLULU\nBOMBAY®\nMANILA\n° BANGKOK\nCOLOMBO\nLABUAN\nSINGAPORE\nHOLLANDIA\nRABAUL\nCANTON IS.\nDJAKARTA\nPORT MORESBY®\nLAE\nCOCOS IS.\nDARWIN\nESPIRITU\nSANTOO\nNOUMEA\nFIJI\n-SAMOA\nO TONGA\nMAURITIUS\n• NORFOLK ISLAND\nPERTH\nSYDNEY\n, AUCKLAND\nMELBOURNE\nCHRISTCHURCH\n-O TAHITI\nLegend\nQANTAS SERVICES\nCONNECTING SERVICES\nQANTAS EMPIRE AIRWAYS LIMITED IN ASSOCIATION WITH B.O. A.C. AND TEAL"
    ],
